WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:13.972
What's going on?

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:17.976
Lü Bu's halberd has begun to glow!

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:21.771
Yes, just as I figured.

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:23.148
That weapon…

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:24.482
Could it be…

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.652
-Isn't that…
-You can't be serious!

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:33.324
That itself is the hidden power
of us Valkyrie.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.661
To defeat the dirty cheats
the gods use for weapons,

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:38.413
we have our own cheat!

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:40.582
Transcendence!

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:46.379
When a Valkyrie's body transforms
into a weapon for humans,

00:00:46.504 --> 00:00:50.800
mankind obtains a weapon of the gods,
in other words, a sacred item.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.427
That ability is called…

00:01:03.354 --> 00:01:05.065
Divine Treasure Forge!

00:01:17.535 --> 00:01:18.536
Völundr!

00:01:43.895 --> 00:01:47.732
An unbreakable foe
and an unbreakable weapon!

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:52.403
That kind of world…

00:01:54.739 --> 00:01:56.407
is the greatest!

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:00.870
The special abilities of the 13 Valkyrie

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:03.081
dwell in the weapons made through Völundr.

00:02:05.416 --> 00:02:07.502
The fourth sister is Randgriz.

00:02:08.002 --> 00:02:09.921
The meaning of her name is…

00:02:11.923 --> 00:02:13.883
"Shield Breaker"!

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:18.471
Mjölnir is a powerful weapon of the gods
that can crush continents.

00:02:19.264 --> 00:02:21.474
However, anyone who wields
its immense power

00:02:21.599 --> 00:02:25.937
and intense lava-like heat
will be annihilated.

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:30.650
Therefore, according to Edda,
the story of Norse mythology,

00:02:30.775 --> 00:02:35.280
Thor wears Járngreipr
to protect his hands.

00:02:37.198 --> 00:02:38.825
In other words,

00:02:38.908 --> 00:02:41.494
the greatest armor
in the heavens, Járngreipr,

00:02:41.619 --> 00:02:44.706
is used to handle the greatest weapon
in the heavens, Mjölnir.

00:02:50.545 --> 00:02:53.548
This spectacle was something
that never should have happened.

